ng_power","r":"management","s":"Alejandro Daniel Lew","x":"This decree states that the Central Government is responsible for indirectly compensating natural gas producers for FX adjustments that were not allowed to be passed through to consumers back in 2018 and hence, its potential rejection by Congress could impact the recoverability of our credit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/12/ypf-sa-ypf-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"YPF 2020 Q2","e":"ypf","d":"2020-08-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Guillermo Emilio Nielsen","x":"Before entering into the specifics of the oil and gas sector in Argentina, where our company does most of its activities, let me start this introduction by saying that after six months of negotiations and following the exchange of numerous restructuring proposals from both sides.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/12/ypf-sa-ypf-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"YPF 2020 Q2","e":"ypf","d":"2020-08-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sergio Pablo Antonio Affronti","x":"We have also started an unprecedented companywide cost reduction program, which includes an open and frank dialogue with unions toward everyone adapting to this new normal.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/12/ypf-sa-ypf-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"YPF 2020 Q3","e":"ypf","d":"2020-11-11","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Alejandro Daniel Lew","x":"Of course, that's regulatory decision, primarily needed or asked for previously by pure up-streamers and the provinces of course because royalties depend much on crude prices or local crude prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/11/ypf-sa-ypf-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"YPF 2020 Q3","e":"ypf","d":"2020-11-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sergio Pablo Antonio Affronti","x":"Another example can be found in our pulling intervention in conventional fields, where we have achieved significant reductions in the number of hours per intervention in addition to tariff renegotiations bringing pulling total cost down by over 30%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/11/ypf-sa-ypf-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"YPF 2020 Q3","e":"ypf","d":"2020-11-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Alejandro Daniel Lew","x":"…costs are expected to increase in coming quarters, primarily in the conventional segment, they should still come in well below the level seen in 2019, as key well services are already showing total cost reductions between 15% and 30% combining both operational efficiencies and lower tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/11/ypf-sa-ypf-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"YPF 2020 Q3","e":"ypf","d":"2020-11-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sergio Pablo Antonio Affronti","x":"During the quarter, we have also pursued periodic price increases at the pump, raising by a cumulative 12% in Argentine pesos as of today.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/11/ypf-sa-ypf-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"YPF 2020 Q3","e":"ypf","d":"2020-11-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Alejandro Daniel Lew","x":"And as was mentioned before, we don't want to bet our future on expectations for future price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/11/ypf-sa-ypf-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"YPF 2020 Q3","e":"ypf","d":"2020-11-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sergio Pablo Antonio Affronti","x":"As I've just mentioned, the resumption in activity was supported by initial results of our cost-cutting effort.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/11/ypf-sa-ypf-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"YPF 2020 Q3","e":"ypf","d":"2020-11-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sergio Pablo Antonio Affronti","x":"Additionally, the voluntar